  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Logistics Cabo Verde &#x2013; Dutch business meet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Dutch government has implemented various interventions in the strategy for the private sector development of Cabo Verde, as well as the promotion of trade and investment in the country One of them is a &quot;Cabo-Dutch business meet&quot;, a seminar as part of the programme in an incoming trade mission from Cabo Verde to the Netherlands, and as a follow-up after the Private Sector Development (PSD) sector studies Cabo Verde.The seminar will promote concrete business opportunities, examine priorities for concrete PSD projects and stimulate more bilateral trade and investment possibilities between the Netherlands and Cabo Verde.</narrative>
  </description>
